<title>FRANCE: Soccer-French league summary.</title>
<headline>Soccer-French league summary.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of a French first division match on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Marseille 3 (Xavier Gravelaine 2, Jean-Philippe Durand 12, Eric Roy 30) Monaco 1 (Anderson 88 pen). Halftime 3-0. Attendance 19,000.</p>
